          "id": 1071648181,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> As far as I can tell using a graphical squiggly underline seems extremely\n> difficult for an object inheriting from QLineEdit\n\nQPainter has a [generateWavyPixmap](https://github.com/qt/qtbase/blob/a7e187cf1631e0f5434c09c4c398a7c4ef138593/src/gui/painting/qpainter.cpp#L5899) function for squiggly underlines, but I don't see how to get there from the public API.",
